<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>GST RCM Reference — Reverse Charge Mechanism Categories</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F0F4F8;
  --accent:#2563EB;
  --accent2:#3B7CF6;
  --accent-light:#EEF4FF;
  --gold:#B45309;
  --gold-bg:#FFFBEB;
  --gold-border:#FDE68A;
  --text:#1E2D45;
  --text2:#4A6080;
  --text3:#8AA0BA;
  --border:#D0DCF0;
  --border2:#B8CCEA;
  --card:#FFFFFF;
  --success:#059669;
  --success-bg:#ECFDF5;
  --danger:#DC2626;
  --danger-bg:#FEF2F2;
  --purple:#7C3AED;
  --purple-bg:#F5F3FF;
  --radius:12px;
  --radius-sm:8px;
  --shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(30,60,114,0.08),0 4px 16px rgba(30,60,114,0.06);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);min-height:100vh}

/* LOGIN SCREEN */
#login-screen{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1B2B4B 0%,#243656 40%,#1a3a6b 100%);padding:2rem}
.login-wrap{width:100%;max-width:420px}
.login-logo{text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.login-logo img{width:76px;height:76px;object-fit:contain;margin-bottom:0.75rem;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.login-logo h1{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:24px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-0.3px}
.login-logo p{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);margin-top:4px}
.login-card{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:2rem;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)}
.login-card h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:3px}
.login-card .lsub{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.lfield{margin-bottom:1rem}
.lfield label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:5px;letter-spacing:0.3px;text-transform:uppercase}
.lfield input{width:100%;background:#F8FAFF;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:11px 14px;color:var(--text);font-size:14px;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;transition:border-color 0.2s,box-shadow 0.2s}
.lfield input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(37,99,235,0.1)}
.btn-login{width:100%;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:13px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:0.3px;transition:all 0.2s}
.btn-login:hover{background:var(--accent2);transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(37,99,235,0.35)}
.login-err{background:var(--danger-bg);border:1px solid #FECACA;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:9px 13px;font-size:13px;color:var(--danger);margin-bottom:1rem;display:none}
.pro-note{margin-top:1.25rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:14px 16px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.65}
.pro-note .pn-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#93C5FD;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:0.3px;text-transform:uppercase}
.login-tagline{text-align:center;margin:0.9rem 0 1.5rem}
.login-tagline h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:17px;color:#fff;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-0.2px}
.login-tagline p{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.55;max-width:380px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.login-footer{text-align:center;margin-top:1.1rem;font-size:10.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);letter-spacing:0.2px}
#app-screen{display:none}

/* HEADER */
.topbar{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1B2B4B 0%,#243656 45%,#1a3a6b 100%);padding:2.25rem 2rem 2rem;color:#fff}
.topbar-inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}
.tb-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:0.7rem}
.tb-logo{width:52px;height:52px;object-fit:contain;flex-shrink:0}
.tb-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#93C5FD;margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.topbar h1{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-0.4px}
.topbar p{font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);margin-top:6px;max-width:760px;line-height:1.55}

.wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:1.75rem 2rem 3rem}

/* SUMMARY STAT CARDS */
.stat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:0.85rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.sc{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:0.95rem 1.1rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow);cursor:pointer;transition:transform 0.12s}
.sc:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.sc-lbl{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:4px}
.sc-val{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)}
.sc-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px}
.sc.blue{border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#EEF4FF,#fff)}
.sc.gold{border-left:3px solid #F59E0B;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFFBEB,#fff)}
.sc.green{border-left:3px solid var(--success);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ECFDF5,#fff)}
.sc.purple{border-left:3px solid var(--purple);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F5F3FF,#fff)}
.sc.rose{border-left:3px solid #E11D48;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF1F2,#fff)}

/* CONTROLS */
.controls{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1rem 1.1rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow);margin-bottom:1.1rem;position:sticky;top:10px;z-index:20}
.ctrl-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.search-box{flex:1;min-width:230px;position:relative}
.search-box input{width:100%;background:#F8FAFF;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px 14px 10px 34px;color:var(--text);font-size:13.5px;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif}
.search-box input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(37,99,235,0.08)}
.search-box .si{position:absolute;left:11px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:14px;color:var(--text3)}
.exp-btns{display:flex;gap:6px}
.ebtn{background:#F8FAFF;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:9px 13px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}
.ebtn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.filter-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
.ftab{background:#F8FAFF;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:7px 14px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.15s;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}
.ftab:hover{border-color:var(--border2);color:var(--text)}
.ftab.active{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.status-toggle{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stog{background:#F8FAFF;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:6px 13px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif}
.stog.active{background:var(--text);border-color:var(--text);color:#fff}
.result-count{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:9px}

/* SECTION HEADER */
.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:1.5rem 0 0.4rem}
.sec-head h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:16.5px;color:var(--text)}
.sec-head .cnt{background:var(--accent-light);color:var(--accent);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:12px}
.sec-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin:0 0 0.7rem;line-height:1.5}

/* TABLE */
.tbl-wrap{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:0.5rem}
table.rcm-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
.rcm-table thead th{background:#F8FAFF;text-align:left;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.4px;padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);white-space:nowrap}
.rcm-table thead th.num{width:34px}
.rcm-table thead th.rate-col{width:90px}
.rcm-table thead th.code-col{width:150px}
.rcm-table thead th.sec-col{width:70px}
.rcm-table thead th.exp-col{width:34px}
.row-main{cursor:pointer;transition:background 0.1s;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.row-main:hover{background:#F8FAFF}
.row-main.withdrawn-row{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#fff 8px,#FAFAFA 8px,#FAFAFA 16px);opacity:0.72}
.row-main td{padding:10px 12px;font-size:12.5px;vertical-align:top}
.rn-num{color:var(--text3);font-size:11px;font-weight:600}
.rn-name{font-weight:600;color:var(--text);line-height:1.4}
.rn-name .wd-tag{display:inline-block;margin-left:6px;background:var(--danger);color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:8px;letter-spacing:0.2px;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle}
.rn-rate{font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);white-space:nowrap;font-size:12.5px}
.rn-rate.igst{color:var(--purple)}
.rn-code{color:var(--text2);font-size:11.5px;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word}
.chev{color:var(--text3);font-size:12px;transition:transform 0.15s;display:inline-block}
.chev.open{transform:rotate(90deg);color:var(--accent)}
.tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:2.5px 7px;border-radius:6px;letter-spacing:0.2px;display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap}
.tag.sec93{background:var(--accent-light);color:var(--accent)}
.tag.sec94{background:#FFF1F2;color:#BE123C}
.tag.sec95{background:var(--purple-bg);color:var(--purple)}
.tag.goods{background:var(--success-bg);color:var(--success)}
.tag.services{background:#FFF7ED;color:#C2410C}

.row-detail{display:none}
.row-detail.open{display:table-row}
.row-detail td{padding:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.detail-inner{background:#FAFBFF;padding:1rem 1.25rem 1.15rem 3.2rem;border-left:3px solid var(--accent)}
.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:10px 22px;margin-bottom:10px}
.dg-item .dg-lbl{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.4px;margin-bottom:3px}
.dg-item .dg-val{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}
.detail-note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px 12px}
.detail-note b{color:var(--text)}
.withdrawn-note{margin-top:8px;background:var(--danger-bg);border:1px solid #FECACA;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--danger);font-weight:500}

.empty{text-align:center;padding:3rem 1rem;color:var(--text3);font-size:13px}

.footnote{margin-top:1.6rem;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.7}
.footnote b{color:var(--text)}
.footnote .fn-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
.footnote .fn-body{display:none}
.footnote .fn-body.open{display:block;margin-top:6px}
.footnote .fn-chev{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);transition:transform 0.15s}
.footnote .fn-chev.open{transform:rotate(90deg)}

.app-footer{text-align:center;margin-top:1.75rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);letter-spacing:0.2px}

/* LOGOUT BUTTON */
.topbar{position:relative}
.logout-btn{position:absolute;top:1.5rem;right:2rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22);color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:7px 16px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;transition:all 0.15s}
.logout-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35)}

/* TAB NAV */
.tab-nav{background:#16233F;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)}
.tab-nav-inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 2rem;display:flex;gap:4px}
.tabbtn{background:none;border:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);padding:13px 18px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;transition:all 0.15s}
.tabbtn:hover{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)}
.tabbtn.active{color:#fff;border-bottom-color:var(--accent2)}

/* CALCULATOR */
.calc-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:1.5rem 1.6rem;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}
.calc-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.calc-icon{width:42px;height:42px;background:var(--accent-light);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0}
.calc-head h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:18px;color:var(--text)}
.calc-head p{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px}
.calc-field{margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.calc-field label{display:block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px}
.calc-field select{width:100%;background:#F8FAFF;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:11px 14px;color:var(--text);font-size:13.5px;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif}
.calc-field select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent)}
.calc-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr;gap:1.1rem}
.amt-input{display:flex;align-items:center;background:#F8FAFF;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:0 12px}
.amt-input span{color:var(--text3);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}
.amt-input input{flex:1;border:none;background:none;padding:11px 8px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text);font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif}
.amt-input input:focus{outline:none}
.supply-toggle{display:flex;gap:6px}
.stbtn{flex:1;background:#F8FAFF;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px 10px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;text-align:center;line-height:1.3}
.stbtn.active{background:var(--accent-light);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.calc-catbox{background:#F8FAFF;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.calc-catbox .cc-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:4px}
.calc-catbox .cc-meta{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text2)}
.calc-catbox .cc-rate-badge{float:right;background:var(--gold-bg);border:1px solid var(--gold-border);color:var(--gold);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:8px}
.calc-result{background:var(--accent-light);border:1px solid var(--border2);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:1.1rem 1.2rem}
.calc-result .cr-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.cr-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
.cr-box{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;text-align:center}
.cr-box.total{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
.cr-box .cr-lbl{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.3px}
.cr-box.total .cr-lbl{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75)}
.cr-box .cr-val{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-top:4px}
.cr-box.total .cr-val{color:#fff}
.calc-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 11px;margin-top:8px}
.calc-note b{color:var(--text)}
.calc-note.warn{background:var(--gold-bg);border-color:var(--gold-border);color:#92400E}
.calc-note.ok{background:var(--success-bg);border-color:#A7F3D0;color:#065F46}
.calc-note.blocked{background:var(--danger-bg);border-color:#FECACA;color:#991B1B}

@media(max-width:640px){
  .logout-btn{position:static;margin-top:14px}
  .calc-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .tab-nav-inner{padding:0 1rem;overflow-x:auto}
}

/* mobile: collapse table to cards */
@media(max-width:800px){
  .topbar{padding:1.75rem 1.25rem 1.5rem}
  .wrap{padding:1.1rem 1rem 2.5rem}
  .controls{position:static}
  .rcm-table thead{display:none}
  .rcm-table, .rcm-table tbody, .row-main, .row-main td{display:block;width:100%}
  .row-main{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
  .row-main td{padding:2px 0;border:none}
  .row-main .rn-num{display:none}
  .detail-inner{padding:0.9rem 1rem}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="login-screen">
  <div class="login-wrap">
    <div class="login-logo">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Creative Smile logo">
      <h1>GST RCM Reference</h1>
      <p>Reverse Charge Mechanism — Category Guide</p>
    </div>
    <div class="login-tagline">
      <h2>From Notification to Compliance—Everything About GST RCM.</h2>
      <p>A comprehensive knowledge platform designed to help professionals understand, verify, and apply Reverse Charge provisions accurately.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="login-card">
      <h2>Sign in</h2>
      <div class="lsub">Enter your credentials to access the reference tool</div>
      <div class="login-err" id="loginErr">Invalid username or password. Please try again.</div>
      <div class="lfield">
        <label>Username</label>
        <input type="text" id="loginUser" placeholder="Username" value="Smart" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')document.getElementById('loginPass').focus()">
      </div>
      <div class="lfield">
        <label>Password</label>
        <input type="password" id="loginPass" placeholder="Password" value="SmartAI" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')doLogin()">
      </div>
      <button class="btn-login" onclick="doLogin()">Sign In</button>
    </div>
    <div class="pro-note">
      <div class="pn-title">📌 Professional Note</div>
      This application is designed to simplify the understanding of GST Reverse Charge Mechanism (RCM) provisions by providing structured references, search facilities, and categorized information. It is intended to assist professionals in improving productivity and decision-making while encouraging verification with the latest statutory provisions before implementation.
    </div>
    <div class="login-footer">© CMA Amit Anant Devdhe</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="app-screen">
<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-inner">
    <div class="tb-head">
      <img class="tb-logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Creative Smile logo">
      <div>
        <div class="tb-badge">📋 GST Reference · For Taxpayers &amp; Professionals</div>
        <h1>Reverse Charge Mechanism (RCM) — Complete Category Guide</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>Every notified RCM category under GST — Section 9(3), 9(4) and 9(5) of the CGST Act, plus Section 5(3)/5(4) of the IGST Act for imports — with GST rate, HSN/SAC, governing notification, effective date and ITC eligibility. Click any row to expand full details. Informational only; always cross-check against the latest CBIC notification before applying.</p>
    <button class="logout-btn" onclick="doLogout()">⎋ Logout</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="tab-nav">
  <div class="tab-nav-inner">
    <button class="tabbtn active" id="tabbtn-reference" onclick="switchTab('reference')">📖 RCM Reference</button>
    <button class="tabbtn" id="tabbtn-calculator" onclick="switchTab('calculator')">🧮 RCM Calculator</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <div id="tab-reference">

  <div class="stat-grid" id="statGrid"></div>

  <div class="controls">
    <div class="ctrl-row">
      <div class="search-box">
        <span class="si">🔍</span>
        <input id="searchInput" placeholder="Search by service, goods, HSN/SAC, notification, keyword…" oninput="render()">
